<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        .order-details {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .detail-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
        }
        .value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>📦 Order In Transit</h1>
            <p>Your delivery is on the way!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{#if buyerName}}{{buyerName}}{{else if sellerName}}{{sellerName}}{{else}}Valued Customer{{/if}},</p>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Great news!</strong> Your order has been accepted and is now being processed for delivery by <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="order-details">
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="label">Order Number:</span>
                    <span class="value">{{orderNumber}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="label">Delivery Address:</span>
                    <span class="value">{{deliveryAddress}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="label">Status:</span>
                    <span class="value"><span class="status-badge">IN TRANSIT</span></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>Your order is now with our trusted delivery partner and will be delivered to the address above. A driver will be assigned shortly to complete the delivery.</p>

            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{trackingLink}}" class="cta-button">Track Your Order</a>
            </p>

            <p><strong>What's Next?</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>A driver will pick up the package from the seller's location</li>
                <li>You'll receive updates as the package moves through our delivery network</li>
                <li>Upon arrival, the driver will contact you to arrange delivery</li>
                <li>You'll need to verify the delivery with a confirmation code</li>
            </ul>

            <p>If you have any questions about your order, please visit our tracking page or contact us at <strong>support@alabamarketplace.com</strong>.</p>

            <div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">
                <p style="font-style: italic; color: #666;">Thank you for choosing Alaba Marketplace!</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2024 Alaba Marketplace. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
